<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Rubika's Space - Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* Base Reset */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        /* Full Page Dark Pink Gradient Background */
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #881b34 0%, #b83b5e 50%, #6a1b29 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 850px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Modern Translucent Section Cards */
        .section-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        /* Header Navigation Menu */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .toggle-btn {
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* Profile Layout: Places Text & Picture Side-by-Side neatly */
        .profile-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .profile-text {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .intro-text {
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }

        /* Glowing Round Frame for Your Photo */
        .profile-img-box {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 190px;
            height: 190px;
            object-fit: cover; /* Keeps your portrait sharp without distortions */
            border-radius: 50%; /* Cuts the image into a perfect circle */
            border: 4px solid #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }

        /* Generic Section Headings */
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Hobbies Simple List Layout */
        .hobbies-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .hobbies-list li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        /* D-Day Counter Box Layout */
        .timer-box {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff4a73;
        }

        .timer {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: monospace;
            color: #ffb3c1;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .timer-desc {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* Guestbook Form Components */
        .guestbook-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .guestbook-form textarea,
        .guestbook-form input[type="text"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            color: white;
        }

        .guestbook-form textarea::placeholder,
        .guestbook-form input[type="text"]::placeholder {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }

        .guestbook-form textarea {
            height: 90px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .guestbook-form textarea:focus,
        .guestbook-form input[type="text"]:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #ffffff;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        /* Submit Interactive Button */
        .submit-btn {
            align-self: flex-start;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #b83b5e;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background-color: #ffb3c1;
            color: #6a1b29;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="wrapper">
        <header class="section-card">
            <div class="logo">Rubika's Space</div>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#hobbies">Hobbies</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#guestbook">Guestbook</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
            <button class="toggle-btn">☀️ / 🌙 Toggle Mode</button>
        </header>

        <section id="about" class="section-card">
            <div class="profile-container">
                <div class="profile-text">
                    <h1>Hello, I'm Rubika Gorachan</h1>
                    <p class="intro-text">
                        I am a 20-year-old student currently studying at <strong>Seoul Theological University</strong>.<br><br>
                        Welcome to my final evaluation portfolio. This page showcases my web development and digital literacy progress throughout this semester!
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="profile-img-box">
                    <img class="profile-img" src="Screenshot 2026-06-07 210601.png" alt="Rubika Gorachan Profile">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="hobbies" class="section-card">
            <h2>My Favorite Hobbies</h2>
            <ul class="hobbies-list">
                <li>🎬 Watching Movies</li>
                <li>💻 Web Coding</li>
                <li>📝 Learning Tech</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="section-card">
            <h2>Countdown to Target Date</h2>
            <div class="timer-box">
                <div class="timer" id="dday-timer">206d 1h 36m 27s</div>
            </div>
            <p class="timer-desc">A dynamic real-time evaluation timer built using JavaScript logic.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="guestbook" class="section-card">
            <h2>Guestbook</h2>
            <form class="guestbook-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
                <textarea placeholder="Leave a message..."></textarea>
                <div style="max-width: 320px;">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name">
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Submit Message →</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>© 2026 Rubika Gorachan. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Seoul Theological University | Department of Computer Science</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
